From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tim Carney <tim.carney@cargt.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 00:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] boards: cargt00414: Cargt i.MX 95 00414 OSM-L SOM

boards/cargt00414 is created from boards/mx95lp5 by the recipe (do_patch
prefunc, without the EVK timing files) before this patch is applied. The
00414 timing file is added by the recipe into boards/cargt00414/ddr/.

 - ddr/Makefile: build from boards/cargt00414/ddr, default to the 00414
   MT62F512M32D2DR (2 GB, 6400 MT/s) timing
 - debug UART on LPUART1, the 00414 console (OSM UART_CON); the EVK's
   LPUART2 pads are the 00414 BOOT_MODE straps

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Cargt board specific]
---
diff --git a/boards/cargt00414/config_board.h b/boards/cargt00414/config_board.h
index 31afdb3..ca75496 100644
--- a/boards/cargt00414/config_board.h
+++ b/boards/cargt00414/config_board.h
@@ -52,7 +52,7 @@
 /* Defines */
 
 /*! Config for UART instance */
-#define BOARD_DEBUG_UART_INSTANCE    2U
+#define BOARD_DEBUG_UART_INSTANCE    1U
 /*! Config for UART baudrate */
 #define BOARD_DEBUG_UART_BAUDRATE    115200U
 
diff --git a/boards/cargt00414/ddr/Makefile b/boards/cargt00414/ddr/Makefile
index 8b3a0e3..93c2313 100644
--- a/boards/cargt00414/ddr/Makefile
+++ b/boards/cargt00414/ddr/Makefile
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-DDR_CONFIG ?= MIMX95_LPDDR5_EVK_19X19_6400MTS_FW2024.09_timing
+DDR_CONFIG ?= cargt00414_MT62F512M32D2DR_2GB_6400MTS_FW2024.09_timing
 OBJS  += $(OUT)/$(DDR_CONFIG).o
 
-VPATH += boards/mx95lp5/ddr
+VPATH += boards/cargt00414/ddr
